  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      84.0,
      236.2,
      326.52,
      297.43
    ],
    "text": "4. Section 6 of the principal enactment is hereby amended by the substitution for the word \u201coperator\u201d of the words \u201coperator or provider\u201d, wherever that word appears in that section.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      84.0,
      297.7,
      326.51,
      358.93
    ],
    "text": "5. Section 10 of the principal enactment is hereby amended by the substitution for the word \u201coperator\u201d of the words \u201coperator or provider\u201d, wherever that word appears in that section.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
