  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      84.0,
      359.2,
      326.5,
      382.93
    ],
    "text": "6. Section 12 of the principal enactment is hereby amended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
